# Unity/AR

- Practices: `.cursor/rules/unity-csharp.mdc` · `docs/architecture/unity-coding.md`
- Map: `docs/README.md`. Setup: `docs/setup/install-and-deploy.md`. Exit: `docs/setup/from-template-to-product.md`.
- Product only in `Assets/_Project/**`. No product features in `MobileARTemplateAssets` / `Samples`.
- Domain = pure C#. Adapters → RoomModel. Snap to RoomModel walls; No-LiDAR re-align = floor + one wall.
- Ask before plugins. Sync docs/rules; extend `.gitignore` for new junk.
